## Why This Is Asked
Tests a practical certificate-bound JWT flow and integration of OIDC/SAML with mTLS in a multi-tenant gateway.

## Key Concepts
- Certificate-bound JWT (CBJWT)
- mTLS authentication
- Certificate fingerprint binding
- SAML-to-claims adapter
- Audience checks and replay protection

## Code Example
